  "prompts": {
    "mechanic": "EXACT attached red gremlin mechanic: huge pointed ears, long red pointed nose, green goggles, dark green vest/chest badge, tool belt, black cropped trousers, black gloves, red feet and connected red pointed tail. 1 Gear trap anticipation crouching, one black glove holding a small metal cog base and other glove with a wrench. 2 rapid assembly crouch BOTH gloves pressing a small low grey metal gear trap into ground, green central switch. 3 withdrawing gloved hands from finished compact trap, same crouch. 4 Junkyard arsenal anticipation assembling a compact improvised grey scrap launcher held in BOTH gloves at chest height. 5 launcher fully assembled, aiming RIGHT slightly upward with elbow braced, muzzle clear. 6 same launcher FIRING posture with subtle shoulder recoil, empty clear muzzle NO blast. 7 lowering launcher and recovering. 8 neutral upright reference stance. Gadgets are connected to fingers, same grey tube weapon across4-7. Never green magical energy; he builds mechanical devices. Eight full-body right-facing poses in4x2 transparent sheet; crisp cartoon cel style, no effects."
  },
